[[File:Shiverpede.png|thumb|250px|Shiverpedes were an insectoid species]]
'''Insectoid''' was a term used to refer to [[species]] with [[insect]]-like features.<ref name="datageo">{{Databank|geonosis|Geonosis}}</ref> The [[Culisetto]] were a [[Sentience|sentient]] insectoid species,<ref name="TFA Visual Dictionary">''[[Star Wars: The Force Awakens: The Visual Dictionary]]''</ref> and the [[Geonosian]]s were semi-insectoid.<ref name="CL 2016">[[Star Wars: Complete Locations (2016)|''Star Wars: Complete Locations'']]</ref> The [[Sugi]] were another sentient race mistaken as insectoid when they donned power suits with insectoid legs.<ref name="Sugi Databank">{{Databank|sugi-species|Sugi (Species)}}</ref> The [[Colicoid]] species was also insectoid<ref name="TRS">[[The High Republic: Tempest Runner (script)|''The High Republic: Tempest Runner'' script]]</ref> as well as the [[Yam'rii]] species.<ref name="HC 8">{{HelmetCollectionCite|8|Helmets}}</ref>

